  "description": "A comprehensive .NET library for working with Xbox 360 and Xbox Original game containers, executables, and metadata. Supports reading ISO, CCI, and GOD containers, extracting XEX/XBE metadata, decrypting/decompressing XEX files, creating ISO files from folders, and fetching marketplace metadata. Includes image processing: XPR/DDS texture conversion, XBE image extraction/replacement, and BIOS logo encoding/decoding. Requires .NET 6.0+. Includes cross-platform native libraries for Windows, Linux, and macOS (x64 and arm64).",
